+ *   - the fixed-function matrix, lights and registers (ffp_vertex);
+ *   - the surface scale (aa_sx, aa_sy) and the inline payload.
+ * The vertex data in guest memory can be rewritten by the game while a batch
+ * is transformed; taking the first result for a repeat is the same as reading
+ * both at that moment, which is what the hardware's own post-transform cache
+ * does. So a repeat takes a copy of the first transform of that index in the
+ * same batch. The tag is the batch's serial number and the index, so an entry
